<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ECC" style="id">- Gofa Full Bible Latin Version Final</book>
  <para style="h">Erata Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Erata Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="toc3">Era</para>
  <para style="toc2">Erata</para>
  <para style="mt1">Erata Maxaafa</para>
  <para style="imt">Gaatha Qofa</para>
  <para style="ip">Erata maxaafan asa de7oy qanthi gideysa xalaala gidonashin, daaburan, dagaman, pirda geellatethaninne xoonetethan kumidaysa bessanaasa. Hessa gisho, xaafey, “Asa de7oy hada” yaagidi ba qofa qoncisees. Ha cinca uray, asa de7uwa wursethi gakanaw wochiya Xoossa oosuwa akeekanaw xoonetis. Gidoshin, asi ba de7ida laytha ubban baw danda7etidaba ubba minnidi oothanaw besseysanne Xoossay immidaban ufaytanaw koshsheysa zorees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Era uraa qofatape daroti ulonne zoko gidida qofataninne ufaysa qanxon kumida qofata bessees. Gidoshin, ha maxaafay geeshsha maxaafaa bolla eqida ammanoy hari attoshin, gaahetonanne sidhen kumida qofata ba gaathan oykana gakanaw dalga gideysa bessees.</para>
  <para style="ip">Ha erata maxaafay asa de7o mastooteda bessiya gisho, daro asati ha maxaafape minthetho demmidosona. Hessadaka, ha qofata oykida geeshsha maxaafay, de7os gita birshethi immiya Xoossan ufaysi oothana mela zorees.</para>
  <para style="iot">Maxaafa Ayfe Qofata</para>
  <para style="io1">Duussa birshethi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ECC 1:1-2:26">1:1—2:26</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ubbabaas wodey de7ees <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ECC 3:1-8">3:1-8</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Cincatethan de7a <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ECC 3:9-6:12">3:9—6:12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Wontoba oonika erenna <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ECC 7:1-11:6">7:1—11:6</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Xoosse boncha iyaw kiiteta <char style="ior">(<ref loc="ECC 11:7-12:14">11:7—12:14</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ECC 1" />
  <para style="s1">Ubbabay Hada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 1:1" />Haysi, Dawita na7aa, Yerusalaamen kawotida cinca uraa qaala.<verse eid="ECC 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 1:2" />He cincay, “Ubbabay hada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:2">ubbabay hadape hada;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:2">ubbabay kumethi hada” yaagis.<verse eid="ECC 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 1:3" />Ba de7iya bessan ubban,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:3">asi daaburidi oothiyaba ubban</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:3">iyaw wodhey aybee?<verse eid="ECC 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 1:4" />Issi yeletethi aadhiya wode, hara yeletethi bessaa oykees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:4">Shin ha biittay merinawuka laametonna de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 1:5" />Awi dolees wullees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:5">nam7antho dolanaw yaa doliya bessaa ellesees.<verse eid="ECC 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 1:6" />Carkoy issi toho duge issi toho pude carkees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:6">qassi yuuyi yuuyi aadhidi, simeretidi yees.<verse eid="ECC 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 1:7" />Goggiya haathi ubbay abban gelees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:7">shin abbay kumi erenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:7">He haathay simmidi gogganaw,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:7">guye ba pultiya bessaa bees.<verse eid="ECC 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 1:8" />Ubbabay salethiyaba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:8">I ay mela salethiyako odi wursanaw danda7etenna.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 1:8">Ayfey xeellidi kalli erenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:8">haythi si7idi, taw gidis geenna.<verse eid="ECC 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 1:9" />Kase hanidabay wontoka simmidi I hanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:9">qassi ha77i hanishe de7eysi kase hanidaba.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:9">Hessa gisho, salo gufanthon oorathabay aybika baawa.<verse eid="ECC 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 1:10" />Oonika, “Heko, haysi oorathaba” giiko, hessi oorathi gidenna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:10">hessi nuuni yeletanaape kase hanidaba.<verse eid="ECC 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 1:11" />Kase aadhida wodetan hanidabata zaaridi hassayabay baawa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:11">guyepe hananabata entafe guye oonika hassayenna.<verse eid="ECC 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cincatethi Hada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 1:12" />Taani cincay, Yerusalaamen Isra7eeles kawo gidada de7as. <verse eid="ECC 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 1:13" />Taani sa7an de7iyaba ubbaa shaakada eranawunne cincatethan pilgada xeellanaw qofa qachas. Yaatada asa ubbaas Xoossay immida de7oy daro daabursiyabaanne ufaysonnaba gideysa akeekas. <verse eid="ECC 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 1:14" />Salope garsan hanidaba ubbaa taani be7as; shin ubbayka hada; carko oykanaw yedetheysa mela.<verse eid="ECC 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 1:15" />Geelli suuranaw danda7enna;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:15">baynaba taybanaw danda7etenna.<verse eid="ECC 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 1:16" />Taani ta wozanan haysada yaagada qopas; “Taape kase Yerusalaame haarida ubbatape taani gitanne cinca gidas. Cincatethinne era guussi I aybeko paacada eras” yaagas. <verse eid="ECC 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 1:17" />Taani cincatethafe, gooshshatethafenne eeyatethafe giddon de7iya dummatethi aybeko eranaw daro daaburas. Shin wursethan hessika carko oykanaw yedetheysa mela hada gideysa eras.<verse eid="ECC 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 1:18" />Cincatethi dariya wode azzanthiyabay darees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 1:18">eri dariya wode qassi metoy darees.<verse eid="ECC 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ECC 2" />
  <para style="s1">Bana Dosoy Hada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 2:1" />Taani taako, “Haaya, ta nena ufaysi aybeko erisanaw lo7oba bessaana” yaagas; shin hessika hada. <verse eid="ECC 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 2:2" />Miichi eeyatethi gideysa, qassi miikoynne ufaysi aykoka go77onnaysa akeekas. <verse eid="ECC 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 2:3" />Ha7ika ta wozanay cincatethan tana kaalethishin, tana woyne ushshan ufaysanaw, eeyaka gidanaw paacas. Asi ba qantha woden salope garsan de7iyaba bolla ay oothiko go77aneko eranaw koyas.<verse eid="ECC 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 2:4" />Issi gitaba oothas; ta daana keethata keexas; woyne tokas. <verse eid="ECC 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 2:5" />Dumma dumma atakiltiyanne ayfe ayfiya mithata tokas; asi shempiya bessaa giigisas. He bessan dumma dumma ayfe ayfiya mithata tokas. <verse eid="ECC 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 2:6" />He mithata ushshanaw, haathe dagaaya bessi zeerada giigisas. <verse eid="ECC 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 2:7" />Addenne macca aylleta shammas; qassi ta son yeletida hara aylletika taw de7oosona. Taape kase Yerusalaamen de7ida asaape aadhiya mehe, deeshenne dorse haaras. <verse eid="ECC 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 2:8" />Ta haariya dumma dumma biittatapenne kawotape bonchetida buqura ehisada, daro worqanne bira taw dagayaas. Qassi, tana sabbidi yexiya addenne macca shiishas; hessa bolla, asas ufaysi immiya daro maccasata shiishas.<verse eid="ECC 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 2:9" />Taani kase Yerusalaamen de7ida oodefeka aadhada gita asi gidas. Ta cincatethayka taara wursethi gakanaw de7is. <verse eid="ECC 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 2:10" />Ta ayfey xeellidabaanne ta wozanay amotidaba ubbaa demmas; ta asatethay koyiya ufaysi ubbaa diggabike. Taani oothida ooso ubban ufaytas; ta daabura wodhey hessa. <verse eid="ECC 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 2:11" />Gidoshin, hessa ubbaa ootha simmada taani akeekiya wode, daro taani iyaw daaburida ubbay hada gideysa be7as. Salope garsan go77iyabay aykoy baawa; ubbay carko oykanaw yedethiya mela.<verse eid="ECC 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cincatethinne Eeyatethi Hada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 2:12" />Hessafe guye, taani cincatethi, eeyatethinne gooshshatethi ayibeko paacada eranaw qofaa doomas. Awude gidinka kawoy oothanaw danda7ey iyape kase kawotida kawoy oothidaysafe harabay aybi de7ii? <verse eid="ECC 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 2:13" />Poo7oy dhumape, cincatethi eeyatethafe lo77o gideysa taani be7as. <verse eid="ECC 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 2:14" />Cinca asa ayfeti iya huuphiya giddon de7oosona; shin eeyati dhuman hemetoosona. Gidoshin, enta nam7aa wursethay issino gideysa akeekas.<verse eid="ECC 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 2:15" />Taani taako, “Eeya gakeya qaaday tanaka gakees; yaatin, taani cinca gideysi tana ay maaddii?” yaagada qopas. Qassi taani ta wozanan, “Haysika hada” yaagas. <verse eid="ECC 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 2:16" />Eeya gidin cinca, hayqope guye, iya hassayey baawa; sinthafe yaa laythan nuuni ubbay dogetidi attana. Eeyay hayqeysada, cincayka hayqees.<verse eid="ECC 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ooson Daaburi Hada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 2:17" />Metope attishin, go77iyabay bayna gisho, ha de7oy tana shaattis. Hessika hada; carko oykanaw yedethiya mela. <verse eid="ECC 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 2:18" />Salope garsan taani daro daaburada demmida ta shaluwa ubbaa taape guyera yaa uraas aggada biya gisho, taani daaburida ubbay tana shaattis. <verse eid="ECC 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 2:19" />Taape guyera yaa addey cinceko eeyeko ooni erii? Shin I oona gidinka, taani daro daaburidabaanne ta cincatethan demmidaba ubbaa baw ekidi, godaa gidana; hessika hada.<verse eid="ECC 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 2:20" />Hessa gisho, salope garsan ta daaburidaba bolla ta wozanay ufaysi qanxis. <verse eid="ECC 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 2:21" />Asi ba de7ida laythan baw de7ida cincatethan, eraninne hiillan daaburidi demmidaba ubbaa aykoka daaburonaysas yeggidi bees. Hessika hadanne gita qoho. <verse eid="ECC 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 2:22" />Yaatin, salope garsan asi daro daaburidi oothidaba ubbaafe ay go77a demmii? <verse eid="ECC 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 2:23" />I ba de7o laythan daaburiya daaburi ubbay azzanopenne muudethafe attishin, hari aybika iyaw gujenna; hari attoshin qammaka iya huuphey qofape shempenna; he ubbayka hada.<verse eid="ECC 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 2:24" />Hiza asas go77a gidiyabay aybe giiko, asi midi uyidi ba daaburan ufaytanaysa. He ufaysay qassi Xoossaa kushiyape imetidaba gideysa taani akeekas.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ECC 3:13">Era 3:13</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 5:18">5:18</ref>; <ref loc="ECC 9:7">9:7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:19">Luqa 12:19</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:32">1 Qoro 15:32</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="ECC 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 2:25" />Iya shene gidonna, min uyin asas ufaysi awun de7ii? <verse eid="ECC 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 2:26" />Xoossaa ufaysiya uraas Xoossay cincatethi, eratethinne ufaysi immees; nagaranchuwas I daaburidi shiishana mela, daabura immees. Shin I shiishidaysa Xoossay ekidi, baw yayiya haras immees. Hessa gisho, ha ubbay hadanne carko oykanaw yedetho mela.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 32:8">Iyyo 32:8</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 2:6">Leemi 2:6</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="ECC 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ECC 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ubbabaas Wodey De7ees</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 3:1" />Ubbabaas wodey de7ees; salope garsan oosetiyaba ubbaas</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:1">wodeynne qammi de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 3:2" />Yeletanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:2">hayqanaw wodey de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:2">Tokanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:2">Shoddanaw wodey de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 3:3" />Wodhanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:3">pathanaw wodey de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:3">Laallanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:3">keexanaw wodey de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 3:4" />Yeekanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:4">miiccanaw wodey de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:4">Kayotanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:4">yexanaw wodey de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 3:5" />Shuchu laallanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:5">shuchu shiishanaw wodey de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:5">Qoometanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:5">duuxanaw wodey de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 3:6" />Koyanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:6">koshshi agganaw wodey de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:6">Shiishi oykanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:6">laallanaw wodey de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 3:7" />Peedhanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:7">sikanaw wodey de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:7">Si77i gaanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:7">odetanaw wodey de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 3:8" />Dosanaw wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:8">ixanaw wodey de7ees.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="ECC 3:8">Olas wodey de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 3:8">saro daanaw wodey de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 3:9" />Yaatin, oosanchoy ba daaburida daaburaape ay wodhe demmii? <verse eid="ECC 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 3:10" />Taani qassi, asa na7i daaburidi oothana mela, Xoossay immida toohoy daro deexo gideysa be7as. <verse eid="ECC 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 3:11" />Xoossay ubbaba iya wodiyan wodiyan loythidi oothis. Xoossay asa wozanan merinatethi wothis; gidikoka, Xoossay oothidaba ubbaa koyrope wursethi gakanaw, asi kumethi eranaw danda7enna. <verse eid="ECC 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 3:12" />Asi ba de7ida laythan lo77iyaba ootheysafenne, ufayteysafe aadhiyabay aybika baynaysa taani akeekas. <verse eid="ECC 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 3:13" />Qassi, asas oothi daaburidi demmiya daaburas gatey, midinne uyidi ufayteysi Xoossaafe iyaw imetida imota.<verse eid="ECC 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 3:14" />Xoossay oothidaba ubbay merinaw de7eysa taani eras; I oothidaba bolla gujanaw woyko iyape denthanaw oodesika danda7etenna. Xoossi hessa oothey, asi iya yayyidi bonchana melasa. <verse eid="ECC 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 3:15" />Ha77i hanishe de7iyabay woyko sinthafe hananaw de7iyaba ubbay kase hanidaba; Xoossay kase hanidabay zaari hananaada koyees.<verse eid="ECC 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pirda Geellatethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 3:16" />Qassi taani, salope garsan xillo pirda bessan iitatethi, xillotetha bessan geney de7eysa be7as. <verse eid="ECC 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 3:17" />Ta wozanan, “Xoossay xilluwanne worduwa nam7aaka pirdas shiishana; Xoossay hanidaba ubbaasinne ooso ubbaas wode qanxi wothis” yaagada qopas.<verse eid="ECC 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 3:18" />Taani taako, “Asi do7ape duumatonaysa enti akeekana mela Xoossay enta paacees” yaagas. <verse eid="ECC 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 3:19" />Ase gidin, do7a gidin, enta qaaday issino; issoy hayqeysada, hankoyka hayqees. Nam7ay issi carko shempoosona; hessa gisho, asi do7ape dummatenna; hessika hada. <verse eid="ECC 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 3:20" />Enti nam7ay issi bessi boosona; nam7ay biittafe medhetida gisho, biitta simmoosona. <verse eid="ECC 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 3:21" />Yaatin, asa shempoy salo pude keyeysanne do7a shempoy biitta duge wodheysa shaakidi erey oonee? <verse eid="ECC 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 3:22" />Asi ba oothida ooson ufayteysafe lo77iya harabay iyaw baynaysa be7as. Iyaw de7iya lo77o qaaday hessa xalaala. Asi hayqi simmin iyape guye haniyaba bessanaw, iya guye ehanaw danda7ey oonee?<verse eid="ECC 3:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ECC 4" />
  <para style="s1">Gene, Daaburanne Bizzatethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 4:1" />Taani zaarada, salope garsan ay mela naaqoy de7iyako be7as. Naaqeteysati minthetho dhayidi yeekosona. Naaqeyisata kushen maati de7iya gisho naaqeteyisata maaddey baawa. <verse eid="ECC 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 4:2" />Taani, “Ha77i paxa de7eysatape kase hayqidaysati lo77o” yaagas. <verse eid="ECC 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 4:3" />Gidoshin, ha nam7atape aadhidi yeletiboonaysatanne salope garsan oosetiya naaquwa be7onayisata qaaday lo77o.<verse eid="ECC 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 4:4" />Asa daaburinne amotidaba demoy, asas ba laggiya bolla de7iya qanaatepe pulteysa be7as. Hessika hada; carko oykanaw kaalo mela. <verse eid="ECC 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 4:5" />Ba kushe idimmidi uttiya azallay koshan hayqees. <verse eid="ECC 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 4:6" />Daaburaninne carko kaalon demmiya dakobaape wopan demmiya issi kushey lo77o.<verse eid="ECC 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 4:7" />Salope garsan hada gididaba haraba be7as. <verse eid="ECC 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 4:8" />Hessika na7i woyko ishi bayna issi bizza addey de7ees. Shin iya daaburas zawi baawa; baw de7iyaban alenna. I bana, “Ta haysa ooddes daaburayna? Taani tana ayis ufaysi diggadina?” yaagidi oychis. Hessika qassi hadanne meto de7o.<verse eid="ECC 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 4:9" />Banta oosuwan lo77o ayfe demmiya gisho issino gideysafe nam7a gideysi lo77o. <verse eid="ECC 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 4:10" />Nam7aafe issoy kundiko issoy denthees; shin barka de7iya uray kundiko iya denthey bayna gisho iya ayye! <verse eid="ECC 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 4:11" />Nam7ay issife zin7iko ho77ees; shin barka zin7iya uraa waanidi ho77anaw danda7ii? <verse eid="ECC 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 4:12" />Issi asi barka teqanaw danda7onna metuwa nam7u asati teqanaw danda7oosona. Heedzu ayfen dooqetida wodoroy elle duuxenna.<verse eid="ECC 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asape Aadhidi Bentoy Hada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 4:13" />Zore ekonna eeyanne ceega kawuwape manqonne cinca gidida na7atetha kawoy lo77o. <verse eid="ECC 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 4:14" />He na7atethay qasho keethafe keyidi woyko manqotethafe dendidi kawo gidanaw danda7ees. <verse eid="ECC 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 4:15" />Salope garsan de7iyanne simeretiya asa ubbay kawa laattiya na7atetha kaalleysa be7as. <verse eid="ECC 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 4:16" />Issi kawoy haariya asaa tayboy daro gidanaw danda7ees. Shin kaalliya yeletethay iya kawotethan ufaytibeenna. Hessika hada; carko oykanaw kaalo mela.<verse eid="ECC 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ECC 5" />
  <para style="s1">Xoosse Yayya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 5:1" />Xoossa keethi geliya wode akeekada tanga. Enti banta iita oosuwa eronna gisho, si7anaw shiiqoy eeyata yarshuwafe aadhees. <verse eid="ECC 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 5:2" />Odetanaw eesotopa; Xoossa sinthan odetanaw ne wozanan dirgofa. Xoossay salona, neeni sa7ana; hessa gisho, ne qaalay guutha gido. <verse eid="ECC 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 5:3" />Qofi dariya wode amuhoy darees; oda daroy eeyatethi qoncisees. <verse eid="ECC 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 5:4" />Xoossas gepidaba polanaw gam7ofa; eeyatan Xoossay ufaytenna. Hessa gisho, neeni gepidaba ubbaa pola. <verse eid="ECC 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 5:5" />Issiba gepidi polonna agganaape koyro geponna agoy lo77o. <verse eid="ECC 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 5:6" />Nagaran nena gelsonna mela ne inxarsa yeda oothofa. Xoossa keethan ootheysako, “Koyro haysa taani akeekona gepas” goopa. Hessi Xoossa daro hanqethiya gisho, ne kushe ooso ubbaa I ba hanquwan dhaysanaw danda7ees. <verse eid="ECC 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 5:7" />Daro amuhoynne daro odi hada. Hessa gisho, Xoossaa yayya.<verse eid="ECC 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Duretethi Hada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 5:8" />Issi biittan manqoti naaqetishin, pirdi geellatishin neeni be7iko malaaletofa. Issi issi halaqaas iyape bollara shuumetidi iya xeelliya hara halaqi de7ees. Qassi entafe bollara shuumetidi enta xeelliya hara halaqati de7oosona. <verse eid="ECC 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 5:9" />Biittafe bentiya wodhey ubbaasa; hari attoshin, kawoyka goshshafe go7etees.<verse eid="ECC 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 5:10" />Bira dosiya uraas biri gidi erenna; duretethi siiqiya uray miishe kalli erenna; he ubbay hada. <verse eid="ECC 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 5:11" />Duretethi dariya wode miya asi darees. Ba shaluwa coo ayfen xeellidi, “Taani dure” gaanape haraba ay maaddii?<verse eid="ECC 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 5:12" />Ooso oothiya asi guuthu min daro min, saro dhisko dhiskees; shin durey ba duretethaas ubba wode un7etiya gisho dhisko dhayidi de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 5:13" />Salope garsan daro azzanthiyaba haraba taani be7as. Hessika iita wode bana asho gidi minjida shalo, <verse eid="ECC 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 5:14" />woyko issi iitabay gakin dhayida duretethi. I na7a yelidaba gidikoka na7aa laatisiyaba dhayidi mela attees. <verse eid="ECC 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 5:15" />Asi ubbay kallo yeletidaysada mela kushe simmidi baana. Ay mela I daaburidi oothikoka ekidi biyabay baawa.<verse eid="ECC 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 5:16" />Asi kallo yeletidi kallo guye simmeysi daro azzanthiya iitabaa. Iya daabura ubbay carko oykiyabada hada gidiko iya ay maaddii? <verse eid="ECC 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 5:17" />I ba laytha ubbaa dhuma de7on, azzanon, yeellan, hargeninne yilon wursees.<verse eid="ECC 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 5:18" />Hiza, taani akeekida issi lo77obay, salope garsan Xoossi asas immida qantha laythan, asi ba daaburaape midi uyidi ufayteysi lo77onne bessiyaba; iya qaaday hessa. <verse eid="ECC 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 5:19" />Xoossi asas duretethinne shalo immey, ba daabura gatiya demmidi, midi uyidi ufaytana melasa; hessika Xoossaafe iyaw imetida imota. <verse eid="ECC 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 5:20" />Xoossi iya wozanan ubba wode ufaysi kunthiya gisho I ba de7o laythaba daro qopenna.<verse eid="ECC 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ECC 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 6:1" />Salope garsan asa bolla gakiya daro iitabaa taani be7as. <verse eid="ECC 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 6:2" />Xoossi asas shalo, duretethinne boncho immees; iyaw koshshiyabaape issibaaka pacisenna. Shin iyaw imetida shaluwaninne duretethan ufaytana mela kumetha maata immenna. Hessa xalaala gidonashin I daaburidi demmidaban hari ufaytana mela oothees; hessika hadanne azzanthiya iitabaa.<verse eid="ECC 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 6:3" />Issi asi xeetu na7a yelidi, adussa laythi de7idi cimanaw danda7ees. Shin I baw imetidaban ufaytonnanne wursethan bonchon moogetonna attiko iyape boshi lo77o gayis. <verse eid="ECC 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 6:4" />He boshay coo yeletidi oonika hassayonna dhumaa biya gisho iya sunthay dhuman kametidi attees. <verse eid="ECC 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 6:5" />I, awa poo7o be7onna woyko aybibaaka eronna attikoka he uraape aadhidi iyaw shempoy de7ees. <verse eid="ECC 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 6:6" />Hessa gisho, ufaysi bayna nam7u mukulu laythi de7iya asape he bosha qaaday lo77o. Wursethan nam7ay issi bessi boosona.<verse eid="ECC 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 6:7" />Asi daaburidi oothiya ubbay baw miyaba demmanaasa; shin iya amoy ali erenna. <verse eid="ECC 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 6:8" />Yaatin, cinca asi eeya asape aybin dummatii? Manqoy daro cincidi, harata sinthan waanidi daaneko eroy iya ay maaddii? <verse eid="ECC 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 6:9" />Amon xuugetanaape ayfen be7oy lo77o;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:9: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ayfen be7oy lo77o: asi amon xuugetishe daanape baw de7iyaban alidi de7o guussu.</char></note> hessika carko oykanaw kaalo mela hada.<verse eid="ECC 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 6:10" />Haniyaba ubbay koyrottidi eretidi de7ees. Issi issi asi waananaw de7iyako adussa wodepe kase eretidi uttis. Ay asika baape minneysara baaxetanaw danda7enna. <verse eid="ECC 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 6:11" />Odi dariya wode hadabay darees; yaatin hessi ase ay maaddii?<verse eid="ECC 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 6:12" />Hada gididi kuyada coo aadhiya ba guutha laytha asi waatidi aathanaw koshshiyako erey oonee? Asi hayqidi aggin salope garsan hananaw de7iyaba asas odanaw danda7ey oonee?<verse eid="ECC 6:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ECC 7" />
  <para style="s1">Cincatethi</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 7:1" />Al77o shittofe lo77o sunthi aadhees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:1">yeletiya gallasape hayqo gallas lo77o.<verse eid="ECC 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 7:2" />Asa ubbaa wursethay hayqo gidida gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:2">gibira keethi beysafe yeeho keethi beysi lo77o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:2">de7on de7iya asi hessa ba wozanan wothanaw koshshees.<verse eid="ECC 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 7:3" />Azzanoy som7o kareethikoka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:3">wozana poo7isiya gisho miichafe azzanoy lo77o.<verse eid="ECC 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 7:4" />Cinca asa wozani yeeho son de7ees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:4">shin eeya asa wozani ufaysa son de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 7:5" />Eeyata yethi si7anaape</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:5">cincata seera sissi lo77o.<verse eid="ECC 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 7:6" />Eeya asa miichi agunthan tama yeddin</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:6">dhuuqeysa mela; hessika hada.<verse eid="ECC 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 7:7" />Gene oosoy cinca asi eeya kessees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:7">wodhaafe ekoy wozana iissees.<verse eid="ECC 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 7:8" />Doomethafe wursethi lo77o;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:8">otorope danda7i lo77o.<verse eid="ECC 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 7:9" />Eeyata hanqoy enta ki7on de7iya gisho,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:9">neeni ne shempuwan hanqos ellesopa.<verse eid="ECC 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 7:10" />“Ha77i wodiyape kase wodey ayis lo77o gididee?” gada oychofa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:10">hessa mela oyshoy cinca asi oychiya oysho gidenna.<verse eid="ECC 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 7:11" />Ha sa7an de7iya asi ubbay cinca gidanaw koshshees;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:11">cincatethi demoy laatape lo77o.<verse eid="ECC 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 7:12" />Miishey ase iitape kammidi ashsheysada cincatethika ashshees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:12">Shin cincatethi miishepe aadhey asa de7o naaganaw danda7iya gishosa.<verse eid="ECC 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 7:13" />Ane Xoossi oothidaba akeeka!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:13">Xoossi geellayidaba ooni suurisanaw danda7ii? <verse eid="ECC 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 7:14" />Sa7i giigida wode ufayta; metoy gakiya wode akeeka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:14">Ufaysi gidin meto gidin Xoossi yeddiya woden yees.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 7:14">Shin awusi koyrottidi yaaneko neeni eraka.<verse eid="ECC 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 7:15" />Ha hada gidida ta laythan darobaa be7as. Hessika, geellay ba geellatethan adussa laythi de7iya wode xilloy qantha laythan hayqees. <verse eid="ECC 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 7:16" />Hessa gisho, neeni elle dhayonnaada daro xillo woyko daro cinca gidopa. <verse eid="ECC 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 7:17" />Neeni wodey gakonna hayqonnaada aadhida iita gidopa; aadhada eeya gidopa. <verse eid="ECC 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 7:18" />Ha ubban Xoosse yayya; asi meto ubbaa xoonon keyanaw danda7iya gisho neeni daro iita woyko daro xillo gidonashin giddo asi gida.<verse eid="ECC 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 7:19" />Cincatethi cincaas immiya wolqay issi katama haariya tammu asata wolqafe aadhees.<verse eid="ECC 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 7:20" />Xillobaa xalaala oothidi nagara oothonna de7iya asi ha sa7aa bolla baawa.<verse eid="ECC 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ECC 7:21" />Asi haasaya qaala ubbaa si7ada polana goopa; neeni ubbaa si7ana giiko ne aylley nena baaddishin si7ana. <verse eid="ECC 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ECC 7:22" />Qassi neeni ne huuphen harata baaddiyaba ne wozanay erees.<verse eid="ECC 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ECC 7:23" />Hessa ubbaa taani cincatethan pilgada be7as. Yaatada, “Taani cinca gidana” yaagas. Shin taani gidaysada hanibeenna. <verse eid="ECC 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ECC 7:24" />Cincatethi ubba wode haahon de7iyabaanne ciimmoba; yaatin, iya koyidi demmanaw danda7ey oonee? <verse eid="ECC 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ECC 7:25" />Taani pilgada xeellanaw cincatethinne oda ubbaa wursethaa eranaw qopas. Nagari eeyatethi, eeyatethi gooshshatethi gideysa eranaw gakas.<verse eid="ECC 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ECC 7:26" />Taani hayqope aadhidi cammiya haraba demmas. Hessika, I wozanay gite, I kushey santhalaata gididi xiheda oykiya issi maccas be7as. Xoosse yayiya asi iipe kessi ekana; shin nagaranchuwa iya ba xihiyan xaaxada oykana.<verse eid="ECC 7:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ECC 7:27" />Astamaarey haysada yaagis; “Taani pilgada demmidabay haysa. <verse eid="ECC 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ECC 7:28" />Hessika, taani hachi gakanaw koyada demmaboonnaba. Mukulu adde asa giddofe bonchoy bessiya issi adde xalaala demmas; shin macca asaa giddofe issinnoka demmanaw danda7abike. <verse eid="ECC 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ECC 7:29" />Taani pilgada demmida harabay, Xoossi ase suure qofara medhis; shin asi daro gene oge koyidi bis” yaagis.<verse eid="ECC 7:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ECC 8" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 8:1" />Cinca asi daaney oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 8:1">Ubbabaas birshethaa erey oonee?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 8:1">Cincatethi pashkisidi, dhumida som7uwa poo7isees.<verse eid="ECC 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kawos Kiitetta</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 8:2" />Kawos kiiteta; kase neeni kiitetana</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="ECC 8:2">gada Xoossa sinthan caaqadasa.<verse eid="ECC 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 8:3" />Kawa sinthafe ellesada keyopa; kawoy ba koydaba oothanaw danda7iya gisho iita ooso oothanaw dendofa. <verse eid="ECC 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 8:4" />Ubbabaa oothanaw kawas maati de7iya gisho, “Ayis haysa oothadii?” yaagidi iya oychanaw danda7ey oonee? <verse eid="ECC 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 8:5" />Iya kiitaa poliya asi qohetenna; cinca asi like wodiyanne oothiya ogiya erees. <verse eid="ECC 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 8:6" />Ase deexo metoy gakikoka ubbabaas wodeynne ogey de7ees. <verse eid="ECC 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 8:7" />Sinthafe hananaba eriya asi baawa; “Haysi hanana” gidi odanaw danda7ey oonee? <verse eid="ECC 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 8:8" />Shempoy shaaketidi biya gallas oykidi teqanaw danda7iya asi baawa; woyko hayqoy ba gallasan yoonnaada digganaw danda7iya asi baawa. Ola wode oonika oletike gaanaw danda7onnaysada iitatethi iita oothiya uraa yeddenna. <verse eid="ECC 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 8:9" />Salope garsan haniyaba ubbaa taani akeekada qopiya wode asi baw de7iya maata hara asi qohanaw go7eteysa be7as.<verse eid="ECC 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 8:10" />Iita asati bonchon moogetishin be7as. Enti iitatetha oothida katamaa asay shiiqidi enta sabbishin si7as; hessi ubbay hada.<verse eid="ECC 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 8:11" />Asi qopidi iitabaa oothiya gaasoy, iitabaa oothida asata ellesidi seerey bayna gishosa. <verse eid="ECC 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 8:12" />Nagaranchoy xeetu toho iitabaa oothishin iya barey aduqikoka, Xoosse yayyeysatasinne boncheysatas sa7i lo77anaysa ta erayis. <verse eid="ECC 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 8:13" />Iitati Xoosse yayyonna gisho sarotethi entaw baawa; enti Xoosse yayyonna gisho enta barey kuyada qaammana.<verse eid="ECC 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asi Xoossa Oge Erenna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 8:14" />Ha sa7an oosetiya hara hadabay de7ees. Hessika, geeshsha asati, nagaranchoti ekanaw bessiya seera ekiya wode nagaranchoti geeshshati ekanaw bessiya lo77oba ekeysa; hessi ubbay hada. <verse eid="ECC 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 8:15" />Asi miyabaape, uyabaapenne bana ufaysiyabape aadhidi lo77obay salope garsan hari bayna gisho, asi ba de7on ufaytiko lo77o gas. Xoossi iyaw immida laythan I daaburidi demmidaban ufaytanaw danda7ees.<verse eid="ECC 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 8:16" />Taani cincatethi aybeko eranawunne asi ha sa7a bolla daaburiya daabura akeekanaw halchas; wursethan asi dhisko dhayidi oothiya oosoy de7eysa be7as. <verse eid="ECC 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 8:17" />Taani Xoossi oothidaba ubbaa be7as. Salope garsan oosetida ooso asi pilgidi eranaw danda7onnaysa eras. Asi ay mela daaburidi pilgi xeellikoka, iya birshethaa eranaw danda7enna. Qassi cinca asi haysa erayis gaanaw danda7enna.<verse eid="ECC 8:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ECC 9" />
  <para style="s1">Ubbaa Naagiya Wursetha Qaada</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 9:1" />Ha ubbaa ta wozanan qopidaape guye cincatinne xilloti, enta oosoti Xoossa kushen de7oosona gada kuuyas. Shin siiqo gidin woyko ixo aybi iya naagiyako oonika erenna. <verse eid="ECC 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 9:2" />Dummatethi bayna ubbaa gakiya qaaday issino; xillo gidin geella, lo77o gidin iita, tuna gidin tuna gidonna ixin, yarsho yarsheysa gidin yarshonaysa ubbaa qaaday issino. Lo77o asas nagaranchuwafe lo77iya qaadi baawa; caaqo yayyeysi yayyonnaysafe dummatenna.<verse eid="ECC 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 9:3" />Asa ubbaa qaaday issino gideysi, ha sa7an de7iya hara iitatethaa mela daro iita. Asi de7on de7ida laytha ubban iya wozanay iitatethaninne gooshshatethan kumidi de7ees; wursethan hayqidi aggees. <verse eid="ECC 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 9:4" />Hayqida gaammofe paxa de7iya kani lo77o; de7on de7eysatara de7iya uraas ufaysi de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 9:5" />De7on de7iya asati issi toho hayqanaw de7eysa eroosona; shin hayqidaysati issibaaka erokona. Enti dogetidaysata gidiya gisho aykoka maaddokona. <verse eid="ECC 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 9:6" />Enta siiqoy, ixoynne qanaate ubbay entara issife dhayees. Hizape guye salope garsan haniyaba ubban merinaw entaw qaadi baawa.<verse eid="ECC 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 9:7" />Ba, ne kathaa ufaysan ma; ne woyne ushsha ne wozanay ufaytin uya. Xoossay hessa new kasepe giigisidi wothis. <verse eid="ECC 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 9:8" />Ubba wode ne ma7oy boothi gido; ne huuphen zayte tiya. <verse eid="ECC 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 9:9" />Salope garsan Xoossay new immida ha hada de7uwan, hada gidida ne qammatan ne siiqiya ne machera ufaytada de7a. Neeni salope garsan daaburada oothidaba ubbaafe nena gakiya saamay hessa. <verse eid="ECC 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 9:10" />Ne kushey oothanaw demmidaba ubbaa ne kumetha wolqan ootha; neeni baana duufuwan oosoy woyko halchoy woyko eri woyko cincatethi baawa.<verse eid="ECC 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 9:11" />Taani salope garsan haraba be7as. Hessika, eeson woxeysati ubba wode xoonokona; mino olanchoti ubba wode olan kanthokona; cincati ubba wode kathi demmokona; hiillanchoti ubba wode duretokona; tamaarida asati ubba wode sabetokona. Shin ubbaa qaadinne wodey gathidaysada hanees.<verse eid="ECC 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 9:12" />Gidoshin he wodey awude yaaneko eranaw danda7iya asi baawa. Kafoy xihen geleysada woyko moloy giten oyketeysada asi ubbay qoponna gakiya iita woden oyketees.<verse eid="ECC 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Cincatethinne Eeyatethi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 9:13" />Salope garsan taani be7idaba harabay de7ees. Hessika cincatethi gita leemiso gideysa. <verse eid="ECC 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 9:14" />Guutha asi de7iya issi guutha katamiya de7awusu. He katamiw issi wolqaama kawoy olanaw dendis; iyo teqidi oykis. <verse eid="ECC 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 9:15" />He katamen manqo gidida issi cinca addey de7ees; I ba cincatethan he katamiw ashshis. Shin he manqo addiya zaaridi hassayday baawa. <verse eid="ECC 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 9:16" />Taani, “Cincatethi wolqaafe aadhees” yaagas. Gidoshin, cinca gidikoka manqo asi kadhetees; I odiyaba si7ey baawa. <verse eid="ECC 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 9:17" />Hessi hanikoka, deriya haareysi eeyata shiiqon waassiya waasuwa si7anaape loddara odetiya cinca asa qaala si7eysi lo77o. <verse eid="ECC 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 9:18" />Cincatethi ola miishepe aadhees; shin issi nagaranchoy daro lo77oba dhaysees.<verse eid="ECC 9:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ECC 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 10:1" />Hayqida udunxeti sawiya shittuwa xinqisoosona; hessadaka, guutha eeyatethi cincatethinne gita bonchuwa iissees.<verse eid="ECC 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 10:2" />Cinca asa wozanay iya ushachi kaalethees; shin eeya asa wozani haddirsi kaalethees. <verse eid="ECC 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 10:3" />Eeya asi oge hemetiya wode iyaw akeeki baawa; I eeya gideysa asi ubbay erees.<verse eid="ECC 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 10:4" />Ne halaqay ne bolla hanqetiko ne bessaa yeddofa; si77i gidi danda7oy gita nagaraa atto giisees.<verse eid="ECC 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 10:5" />Salope garsan taani be7ida hara iitabay de7ees. Hessika deriya haareysati oothiya naaquwa. <verse eid="ECC 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 10:6" />Eeyati daro dhoqa shuumatetha oykidi de7iya wode dureti ziqa bessan uttidosona. <verse eid="ECC 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 10:7" />Taani aylleti haareysatada para toggidi bishin qassi haareysati aylletada tohon hemetishin be7as.<verse eid="ECC 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 10:8" />Olla bookiya asi he ollan kundees; gimbe dirsi laaliya uraa shooshi dukees. <verse eid="ECC 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 10:9" />Shuchu denthiya asi he shuchan, mithi qeriya asi he mithan deshetees.<verse eid="ECC 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 10:10" />Dun7ida kalta leefonna qeriko daro wolqaa wursees; shin cincatethan oothiya oosuwas ayfey de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 10:11" />Shooshi duki aggin shooshu doqiya dhale wotheysi he uraa aykoka maaddenna.<verse eid="ECC 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 10:12" />Cinca asa odi iyaw boncho imisees; shin eeyay ba doonape keyida qaalan baw meton gelees.<verse eid="ECC 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 10:13" />Eeyay ba haasaya eeya qaalan doomidi, iitatethaninne gooshshatethan polees.<verse eid="ECC 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 10:14" />Eeya asi darobaa odetees. Gidoshin, sinthafe hananaw de7iyaba oonika erenna. Asi hayqi aggin, haniyaba iyaw odanaw danda7ey baawa.<verse eid="ECC 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ECC 10:15" />Eeya asi ba ooson daaburees; I ba soo biya ogiya erenna.<verse eid="ECC 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ECC 10:16" />Na7a gidida kawoynne wonta guura gibira miya halaqati de7iya biitte nena ayye! <verse eid="ECC 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ECC 10:17" />Bonchetida kawoynne mathotanaw gidonashin wolqanne minotethi demmanaw maaran miyanne uyaa halaqati de7iya biittiya anjetidaaro.<verse eid="ECC 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ECC 10:18" />Addey azalla gidiko iya kaaray woddees; iya kushey oothonnaba gidiko, iya keethay xokees.<verse eid="ECC 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ECC 10:19" />Kathi muussaninne woyne ushshan ufaysi bentees; shin miishey ubbaba shammees.<verse eid="ECC 10:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ECC 10:20" />Si7iya asi baawa gada ne wozanan kawo cayopa; woyko ne zin7iya kifiliyan dure uraa baaddofa. Ne gidaysa salo kafoy bidi entaw odanaw danda7ees.<verse eid="ECC 10:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ECC 11" />
  <para style="s1">Dumma Dumma Zoreta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 11:1" />Ne kathaa haatha bolla yegga; daro gallasape guye neeni zaarada demmana. <verse eid="ECC 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 11:2" />New de7iya shaluwa laapun woyko hospun bessan shaakada wotha. Sinthafe ha sa7aa bolla ay iitabay yaaneko neeni eraka.<verse eid="ECC 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 11:3" />Shaari ira tookiko biitta bolla iri bukees.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ECC 11:3">Mithi pude kundin duge kundin ba kundida bessan de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 11:4" />Carko naagiya oonika kathi zerenna; shaari dendana gakanaw naagiya oonika ba kathaa cakenna.<verse eid="ECC 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 11:5" />Carkoy biya ogiyanne na7i ba aaye ulon waanidi medhetiyako ne eronnaysada ubbaba medhida Xoossay ba oosuwa waati oothiyako eranaw danda7aka.<verse eid="ECC 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 11:6" />Guura gidin omarsi ne zerethi zereysa aggofa; wontaysi woyko omarsaysi lo77aneko neeni eraka.<verse eid="ECC 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ne Na7atetha Woden Xoossa Qopa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 11:7" />Poo7oy ufaysiyabaa; awa ayfe be7oy lo77oba. <verse eid="ECC 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 11:8" />Asi adussa laythi ha sa7an de7iko he laythan ufayto. Shin ha alamiyabay hada gideysanne yaana dhuma wodey merinaw daanaysa qopo.<verse eid="ECC 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 11:9" />Neno na7atethaw, na7atethi daro lo77oba gidiya gisho ne na7atetha laythan ufayta; ne wozanayka ufayto. Ne ayfey be7idabaanne ne wozanay amotidaba ubbaa pola. Shin he neeni oothidaba ubbaa gisho nena Xoossay pirdanaw de7eysa dogopa.<verse eid="ECC 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 11:10" />Na7atethinne goobatethi hada gidiya gisho ne wozanaape azzano, ne asatethafe iitatethi digga.<verse eid="ECC 11:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ECC 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ECC 12:1" />Ne na7atetha laythan nena medhidaysa qopa. Un77a gallasati yoonna de7ishin, “Haysi tana ufaysenna” geetetiya wodeti gakonna de7ishin, <verse eid="ECC 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ECC 12:2" />awinne poo7oy, ageeninne xoolintoti dhumonna de7ishin, iri bukidi aadhin, shaari simmonna de7ishin, nena medhidaysa qopa. <verse eid="ECC 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ECC 12:3" />He wodey keethe naageysati kokoriya wode, mino asi kuuniya wode, gaacceysati taybon guuxida gisho gaache aggiya wodenne maskootera xeelleysati daaburiya wode gidana. <verse eid="ECC 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ECC 12:4" />He wodey, wogga ogiyako simmida pengeti gordetiya wode, gaacciya woxa girsay ziqi giya wode, kafo waasoy ase dhiskofe barkisiya wode, macca nayta yetha girsay lepiya wode gidana. <verse eid="ECC 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ECC 12:5" />He wodey, dere keyanaw xoonetiya wode, dalga ogetara hemetanaw yashshiya wode, lawuze mithi ciiyiya wode, booley qaaxanaw xoonetiya wode, amoyabay aggiya wode gidana. He wodey, asi ba merinaa keethaa biya wode, yeekeysati dalga ogiyara yeekishe yuuyiya wode gidana.<verse eid="ECC 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ECC 12:6" />Bira santhalaatay duuxonna de7ishin, worqa kerey meqonna de7ishin, haatha otoy pultuwa matan meqonna de7ishin, haathe ollafe goochi kessiya wodoroy duuxonna de7ishin, <verse eid="ECC 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ECC 12:7" />biittay biittako simmonna de7ishin, shempoy bana immida Xoossaako simmonna de7ishin, nena medhidaysa qopa. <verse eid="ECC 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ECC 12:8" />Astamaarey, “Hada! Hada! Ubbabay hada” yaagis.<verse eid="ECC 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuusha Qofata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ECC 12:9" />Astamaarey cinca xalaala gidonashin eraka gidiya gisho deriya tamaarsis. I daro leemisota pilgidi issuwa issuwa iya maaran maaran dummayidi wothis. <verse eid="ECC 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ECC 12:10" />Astamaarey like gidida qaala demmanaw koyis; hessa gisho, I xaafidabay suurenne tuma.<verse eid="ECC 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ECC 12:11" />Cincata qaalay henthanchoy wude laagiya xeera oco xam7a mela. Issife shiiqida leemisoti gathi oythiya mismaare mela.<verse eid="ECC 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ECC 12:12" />Ta na7aw, ha ubbaafe bollara neeni naagetanaw koshshiyabay de7ees. Maxaafa xaafidi wursanaw danda7etenna. Qassi darobaa pilgidi aggonna ixoy asatethi daabursees.<verse eid="ECC 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ECC 12:13" />Heko ubbabay odetis; ubbabaas kuushshay haysa; Xoosse yayiya; iya kiitaa naaga; hessi asas waanna ooso. <verse eid="ECC 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ECC 12:14" />Xoossay ooso ubbaa qassi geemmida ubbaa lo77o gidin iitaa pirdanaw de7ees.<verse eid="ECC 12:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ECC 12" />
</usx>